WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.000
- Ah, I miss the breeze.

00:00:27.791 --> 00:00:29.500
- Yikes, y'all look rough.

00:00:30.041 --> 00:00:31.916
WHAT? I DON’T LOOK GREAT EITHER.

00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:36.125
- I’m just excited for another midseason trip to a
normal, not creepy American house!

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.208
- I feel like we used to have better records.

00:00:39.291 --> 00:00:40.375
[Knocking on door]

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:43.041
- Bro…how’re the vibes?

00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:45.291
- What the f--k is he talking about?

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:47.791
- Ya know, the goofy good-good shish, brah?

00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:49.458
- Sorry, we can’t let you into the playoff house..

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:50.541
- Wait, where’d they go?

00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:52.333
- I’m sure everything is fine.

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:54.541
I have total situational awareness.

00:00:55.041 --> 00:00:56.625
- I’m having trouble getting reception, ehh?

00:00:57.208 --> 00:00:58.625
[Phone buzzing]
- [Alvin Kamara:] Yeah, same.

00:00:58.708 --> 00:00:59.791
[Pounding on door]

00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:00.750
- Come in!

00:01:01.125 --> 00:01:02.541
Oh, sorry, Canadian reflex.

00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:04.041
- [Together:] AHHH!!!

00:01:04.166 --> 00:01:06.458
- It’s two masked guys and Kyler Murray!

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:07.666
- No. It’s not me, fam.

00:01:07.916 --> 00:01:09.791
- Nah, that’s Kyler.
- He’s very recognizable.

00:01:09.958 --> 00:01:13.333
- Hey, I’m Joe Burrow, and it doesn’t even bother me that I’m on the Bengals.

00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:14.916
- [Together:] Ahhh!

00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:17.291
- ♪♪♪ I love you, but just one question ♪♪♪

00:01:17.291 --> 00:01:19.541
♪♪♪ Aren't we all doomed for regression? ♪♪♪

00:01:19.541 --> 00:01:20.583
[Record skipping]
♪♪♪ Doomed for regression ♪♪♪

00:01:21.041 --> 00:01:22.208
♪♪♪ Doomed for regression ♪♪♪

00:01:22.333 --> 00:01:23.583
♪♪♪ Doomed for regression ♪♪♪
- Laser kick!

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:23.791
♪♪♪ Doomed— ♪♪♪

00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:24.291
- Oww.

00:01:24.916 --> 00:01:27.541
- [Together:] Oh yeah, Washington was in the playoffs last year.

00:01:27.541 --> 00:01:30.333
- I won't be long, in the NFC East we just sorta treat the playoffs like a timeshare.

00:01:30.666 --> 00:01:31.541
Enjoy the playoffs!

00:01:31.541 --> 00:01:32.791
- Aww, thank you. We won't.

00:01:34.416 --> 00:01:36.041
- Hot Rod, has gone cold.

00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:37.791
- They sunk our Blankenship!

00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:39.583
- We need to get over to the playoff lock cabin!

00:01:40.291 --> 00:01:41.666
- Who wants s'mores?!

00:01:41.666 --> 00:01:44.416
- I don't want s'more. I want s'most.

00:01:45.041 --> 00:01:45.916
- OK, I think it's this key.

00:01:46.083 --> 00:01:47.416
- Hey, what's up, fam? I'm everywhere.

00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:49.791
- OH GOD, THEY MUST HAVE GOOD COACHES.

00:01:50.166 --> 00:01:52.708
- OK, so the mistake most slashers make is
you gotta make sure they’re dead.

00:01:53.166 --> 00:01:54.791
Analytics prefers an extra stab or two.

00:01:54.791 --> 00:01:56.583
- Yeah, sure whatever. What are you wearing, bro?

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:57.916
- Get it? I'm Zac Sailor!

00:01:57.916 --> 00:02:00.458
I thought we were all dressing up for the Halloween episode.

00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:03.541
- Mmm, I love the Chase.

00:02:03.541 --> 00:02:04.666
- But I'm Chase!

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:05.541
- Different Chase.

00:02:05.541 --> 00:02:07.791
- OW, OH, SOARIE FOR SCREAMING.

00:02:08.291 --> 00:02:09.000
- They got Claypool.

00:02:09.666 --> 00:02:12.166
I think my window has closed,
But you could still make a run.

00:02:12.416 --> 00:02:14.416
- But we forgot to invest in defense!

00:02:14.416 --> 00:02:15.708
- Then win in a shootout.

00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:17.791
- Don’t f--king touch me. I said I’m out.

00:02:18.166 --> 00:02:19.791
- Coming for that playoff spot.

00:02:20.208 --> 00:02:23.291
- [Patrick Mahomes:] EAT PIGSKIN, PLAYOFF STRANGERS! AHHH!!!

00:02:24.041 --> 00:02:24.458
Hello?

00:02:24.541 --> 00:02:25.541
- Your record is the same...

00:02:25.791 --> 00:02:27.291
AS THE BRONCOS!

00:02:27.291 --> 00:02:30.000
[Screaming]

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.500
- We are hearing reports that a dangerous man has
escaped from Detroit.

00:02:36.625 --> 00:02:37.750
- [Mahomes:] What happened here?

00:02:38.041 --> 00:02:39.625
- I know! I can’t believe this either.

00:02:39.916 --> 00:02:40.416
- AHHH!

